# A Foundry unit test as one trace with three top-level calls over DAP: the test
# contract's deployment, `setUp()`, and `test_Increment()`. Each root frame shows its kind,
# and `next` from the end of one call goes on into the next. No node: the trace is a
# fixture.
# REQUIRES: soldb-dap
# RUN: python3 %{project_root}/test/dap-session.py %{soldb_dap} %{project_root}/test/fixtures/foundry-unit-test/trace.json %{project_root}/test/fixtures/foundry-unit-test/contracts.json next next next next next next 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: stopped: entry
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [deployment] CounterTest (step 0: PUSH1 @ pc 0) Counter.t.sol:6
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: setUp (step 41: JUMPDEST @ pc 56) Counter.t.sol:9
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [setup] CounterTest (step 40: JUMPI @ pc 40) Counter.t.sol:6
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: setUp (step 46: PUSH1 @ pc 77) Counter.t.sol:10
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [setup] CounterTest (step 40: JUMPI @ pc 40) Counter.t.sol:6
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: setUp (step 115: PUSH0 @ pc 177) Counter.t.sol:11
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [setup] CounterTest (step 40: JUMPI @ pc 40) Counter.t.sol:6
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: setUp (step 374: JUMP @ pc 312) Counter.t.sol:9
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [setup] CounterTest (step 40: JUMPI @ pc 40) Counter.t.sol:6
# The test call starts with none of setUp's frames.
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [execution] CounterTest (step 377: PUSH1 @ pc 0) Counter.t.sol:6
# CHECK-NEXT: stopped: step
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: test_Increment (step 406: JUMPDEST @ pc 66) Counter.t.sol:14
# CHECK-NEXT: frame: [execution] CounterTest (step 405: JUMPI @ pc 51) Counter.t.sol:6

# A breakpoint in the last call stops there.
# RUN: python3 %{project_root}/test/dap-session.py %{soldb_dap} %{project_root}/test/fixtures/foundry-unit-test/trace.json %{project_root}/test/fixtures/foundry-unit-test/contracts.json break %{project_root}/test/fixtures/foundry-unit-test/test/Counter.t.sol:16 continue 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BREAK

# BREAK: breakpoint: {{.*}}test/Counter.t.sol:16 verified=True
# BREAK-NEXT: stopped: breakpoint
# BREAK-NEXT: frame: test_Increment (step 559: PUSH1 @ pc 437) Counter.t.sol:16
# BREAK-NEXT: frame: [execution] CounterTest (step 405: JUMPI @ pc 51) Counter.t.sol:6
